    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <h2 class="section-heading">4 Communications</h2>
        <div class="content-block">
            <p>Communications are critical during a recall. Not only for the company to issue information internally and externally, but to correct misinformation and engage with consumers to address questions and concerns.</p>
            <p>Despite the use of digital channels for companies to communicate, the potential for reputational harm is huge.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Considering many F&B processing facilities run <span data-field="operating_hours">{{ operating_hours }}</span>, costs can add up quickly when faced with even a minor interruption.</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <h2 class="section-heading">5 Preparation and prevention</h2>
        <div class="content-block">
            <p>Facing growing production demands and greater scrutiny by regulators and consumers, F&B manufacturers must proactively address reliability and preventative maintenance, recall preparedness, and crisis management, and technology.</p>
            <p>Food traceability is the ability to follow the movement of a food product and its ingredients through all steps in the supply chain.</p>
            <p>Traceability involves documenting and linking the history of a food product, from the point of origin of food products and ingredients.</p>
            <p>In the case of a foodborne illness outbreak or contamination event, efficient product tracing helps governments and those who produce food to quickly identify the location of the contamination and the source of where contamination may have occurred.</p>
            <p>Considering human error is a leading cause of contamination in a facility, it is important to have overtime and extended shifts fill labor shortage and to have a robust maintenance program and digitization reduce risks and need to be an integral part of planning.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="page-header-info">
        <div class="page-header-logo">ABB SAFETY SERIES</div>
