    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <h2 class="section-heading">6 Application</h2>
        <div class="content-block">
            <p><strong>Food & Beverage production safety is all about the correct product for the correct application.</strong></p>
            <p>From materials that hold up to high pressure and caustic cleaning and environmental demands such as CIP (Clean-in-Place) and washdown, to solutions that provide easy visual detection, deliver reliable performance, and support continuous operations.</p>
            <p>ABB works with food and beverage partners to assess their needs and provide the right solutions.</p>
            <p><strong>The Food & Beverage industry is constantly changing, and manufacturers are looking for ways to produce products faster, safer and more profitably.</strong></p>
            <p>Regulations, and advances enabling easier identification of contaminants.</p>
            <p>The good news is F&B manufacturers have more options than ever before to consider, including new technology and automated processes that make it easier to reduce and prevent recalls and outages.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

